  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d946ffa5-a7ab-4f90-93a5-b14314412bb6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a84b5b27-fa83-4421-9d83-79f474ac1488\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-db797b49-ca6e-4df1-9c88-13c85e7571a7\">어제 백화점에서 호두과자를 한박스 샀다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e9479e94-e657-4d55-84dc-83fae876ad24\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e82a6d81-b383-4526-83f2-046bf326147b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ae22c139-a89a-49f8-be5e-ce11d7953ce5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:620px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-ae22c139-a89a-49f8-be5e-ce11d7953ce5\", \"src\" : \"https://search.pstatic.net/common/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fblogfiles.naver.net%2FMjAyNDAxMDdfMjY5%2FMDAxNzA0NjMxNzk0NjI1.oojWWBZdl1vDjQcFU8FeN6G8pO39VbBUC-57jy5OgGQg.S3l5CKcNFKIp_JTZORPaor_7n2Gn6sjJH-_NaEx-u7sg.JPEG.miso2130%2FIMG_8600.jpg&type=sc960_832\", \"originalWidth\" : \"620\", \"originalHeight\" : \"827\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://search.pstatic.net/common/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fblogfiles.naver.net%2FMjAyNDAxMDdfMjY5%2FMDAxNzA0NjMxNzk0NjI1.oojWWBZdl1vDjQcFU8FeN6G8pO39VbBUC-57jy5OgGQg.S3l5CKcNFKIp_JTZORPaor_7n2Gn6sjJH-_NaEx-u7sg.JPEG.miso2130%2FIMG_8600.jpg&type=sc960_832\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-8dd91c9f-4bf9-40f4-a993-3f61838d906c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e0aae22-b2ac-4cd7-be28-6b5d3521c93e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-631089e3-55a2-4e67-805d-e326959b4f13\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a30f2f5-10d5-49e1-b07d-9d47a1766fa9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5b7c9153-63e4-42be-8f29-d73fcdfa7f9b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-db67803e-dd3a-40c1-8a61-0aa2c1eee093\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-69a573a2-a544-4503-aedd-79001db4b432\">두개만 먹고 나머지는 사무실에 가져가기 위해 문 앞에 놨다. 문 앞에 놔둔 호두과자를 사무실에 가져가기 위해 챙겼다. 사무실 오는 길에 자연스럽게 호두과자 박스 안으로 손이 갔다. 호두과자를 먹고 싶다는 생각도 없었고 배가 고프지도 않았는데 호두과자를 먹었다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d27d7bed-6475-4c95-8243-3fc9d73067fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-039c148f-ef7a-4e46-88b6-4357fa366cd8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dc75a83a-36c3-4aa9-b407-f801cbfa4343\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e3e44ca-f119-4fb1-ac94-fead387b8fc8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cb1bb8c1-8997-4695-a6ee-f29cca8cb803\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ef8ecf35-d91f-4f75-9834-11e9561ac07e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6071fba8-4301-4907-b560-2b9e32a5167e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b44d4f67-9e04-4007-ba1c-5afbf7ce75ab\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3d920fd-8155-4761-b439-74581fea4a57\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-99ba2493-52b4-4889-8c00-df43a4fa7abd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a22afdb-b8d7-448a-b42a-a860eebfc721\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4251691e-95f9-4e51-aef6-19c4cac46151\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-80ade4a7-8357-4b0f-9dff-3e78eb2733d0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a43d7236-ffad-48d2-8d7f-a6e5231ee924\">우리 팀은 오후 2시면 모두 부퇴사 카페에 들어온다. 카페에 글을 남기기 위해서다. 2시에 그냥 카페에 글을 쓴다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c9c373ea-0182-4b6e-aa17-f2caa7d0ee6f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-985221eb-f210-420a-a6fd-e231fd27c66b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-1037a1e7-cae6-4f5a-a574-bb37593af426\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-1037a1e7-cae6-4f5a-a574-bb37593af426\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMTEx/MDAxNzA1OTg4ODkyMTcy.Byjz82C7eqquySUmOp84ISZCHEHPW3bsAkB4Jhiig-wg.7_W_nhCprI1dKbOCa6ABDYVNp0P6PHJCLHBKm0Dc7rkg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"2573\", \"originalHeight\" : \"1323\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMTEx/MDAxNzA1OTg4ODkyMTcy.Byjz82C7eqquySUmOp84ISZCHEHPW3bsAkB4Jhiig-wg.7_W_nhCprI1dKbOCa6ABDYVNp0P6PHJCLHBKm0Dc7rkg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-78b012a7-78e8-40bf-82f3-9b22862bd216\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-452858b1-7354-4360-94a0-92c7eb09883e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-68f5f20e-2bd0-42fc-9cd9-7210d3e3ec3a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-911471c9-9b6a-4233-bf12-e6c88dbcbf5d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0ef4cf9c-12c8-4ba8-8226-1d6166500664\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eab5ca87-7210-4868-87f3-88d8fcaeb6f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c89cae4f-9ca5-4139-ba26-4917c1b5787b\">그렇게 2개월만에 카페 활동 점수가 2배 상승했다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-903eb1de-2bdc-49df-84ce-4d0dc32eb1d4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7884b674-d83b-4695-9642-55595d8ca6a6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3447de6c-5315-426e-890d-d0aa976a7cd2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-3447de6c-5315-426e-890d-d0aa976a7cd2\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMjc0/MDAxNzA1OTg2MTMwOTY1.R5tVH3eNO7a_HRBMjBXbNaF_KQ_sRvX5hbg868TNoG0g.pLA19PdOfKN1oa1DZZDRBSVGgNRj9AWguCzr9aqnbEYg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1158\", \"originalHeight\" : \"520\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMjc0/MDAxNzA1OTg2MTMwOTY1.R5tVH3eNO7a_HRBMjBXbNaF_KQ_sRvX5hbg868TNoG0g.pLA19PdOfKN1oa1DZZDRBSVGgNRj9AWguCzr9aqnbEYg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-671de235-4b3f-42c1-8882-e24e232bd7ae\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c06802fb-c0aa-4637-939b-0e7de0892496\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-058c80cf-6fa0-484b-8396-5048b264ce23\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d4db601f-5c8b-44b8-91a3-d506ae6b27b6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f30d1ffd-d1fb-44f6-9959-b3cbec579930\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aadc4940-5bb0-4a1b-9d94-e3d90d57e522\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2130ae0f-7479-4f40-8cc8-aefb9c58bf90\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d423725c-facc-4074-a359-8e82d2fadeb7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e8b33583-e3a0-4c4d-9972-881eaaac597e\">보스턴에 있는 한 병원에서 실험을 했다. 스스로 의지를 갖거나 동기를 변화시키지 않고도 병원 직원과 방문객들의 식습관을 더 낫게 만들수 있는 방법을 위한 실험이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3faad6f0-f930-4360-b3a7-9699e626d119\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1a93e086-cc15-47f3-a19d-a98f733f47e7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27834c55-a9af-4512-8e34-8d2d167bab53\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-295d9b5e-1a2f-4272-8678-d703ac970e23\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-90e2b980-4365-47bc-b2d8-f435d484502d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-caa214c4-0b10-4089-8fca-e335ff9ed342\">식당 안 음료 배치를 바꾸는 것부터 시작했다. 연구자들은 냉장고마다 생수병을 추가해서 넣어두었고, 음식 배식대 옆에 생수병이 담긴 바구니를 놓았다. 주요 냉장고들 안에는 여전히 탄산음료가 있었지만, 모든 탄산음료 옆에 물도 놓았다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0bfa5f46-f873-470d-9d01-2c0f5fe9dfb8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-14ecf486-b359-4248-9db4-66fe962a43ba\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-70456bb0-9d8e-48fc-b0c4-5ca266753431\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:552px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-70456bb0-9d8e-48fc-b0c4-5ca266753431\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMjUz/MDAxNzA1OTg1NzA5NDg0.Yzvv9E1tU3cVhG1HTfCHWKiKLhgJWODsiZhJndXboZcg.yrlTBoJ_BYxVuG8PUk12ExjZYpNOAnx9w3ctWHfu2Pcg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"552\", \"originalHeight\" : \"400\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAxMjNfMjUz/MDAxNzA1OTg1NzA5NDg0.Yzvv9E1tU3cVhG1HTfCHWKiKLhgJWODsiZhJndXboZcg.yrlTBoJ_BYxVuG8PUk12ExjZYpNOAnx9w3ctWHfu2Pcg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-caption\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b10de028-6fe2-4a55-8644-67e86e5ea3bb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f13eb49a-bad0-429e-a11f-dc425690dea2\">어둡게 칠해져 있는 부분이 생수가 있었던 곳이다.</span></p></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-04774713-a882-4cd1-9c04-0c61eb3ee0e8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d25e61d4-df82-49d5-b13a-3c7ad1f7efcf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ee3d74ed-7ae7-4b8d-bc8f-6e5ec93469d4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-41cacaa8-dc20-4846-81dc-bc52746df341\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ce1bc8c9-2a21-467b-ae07-9a283f3e2ef2\">이후 3개월동안 병원의 탄산음료 판매는 11.4%p가 감소했다. 반면 생수 판매는 25.8%p 증가했다. 이후 연구자들은 음식에 대해서도 한가지 조정을 더 했고, 비슷한 결과가 나타났다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-666f6b6f-0a48-4192-98a9-13f484ad0d62\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-03d34e39-1a94-42a8-b8bc-e34845774f44\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b62a2222-4624-4667-82a0-ebfb8be4e747\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2ceea3f1-4ceb-40f7-af42-75f5ae4a3139\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dd638652-804e-4d47-9d63-b4cfa395b957\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-81a1c6e4-6271-477e-8af0-a06de3475c2e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b415b2d9-857e-4f13-a6ea-67dc0cfc5842\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b56d718f-24cd-4831-9a0a-823794d43219\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-36655c55-d743-420e-b7b1-a868111a8d42\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b9350c18-7499-4f76-9287-f1a316a105ad\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b9c3962-b539-465c-ab7d-c5bbdf3f4664\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ae07e5b6-41a1-490e-9ea5-24d21f482fac\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-89bebe5b-d9e8-4d78-b1bd-818366262ae4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fea327a4-5fcd-458a-9962-e9c7cecf0213\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bba2a29b-bf63-4c75-aeaf-74d8140de69b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-061e1ae1-1d55-46bd-9aa0-129ce60218ab\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-528e102b-ef0b-4b4e-ae52-543ce2684170\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-025f56d8-f9c9-4b1a-8e9c-fd34eed11af6\">특정 행동들은 특정한 환경 아래서 반복적으로 나온다. 도서관에서는 속삭이며 대화를 나누고, 어두운 길에서는 주변을 살피며 방어적 태도로 행동한다. 어떤 누구라도 인간이라면 그렇게 행동한다. 대부분의 행동은 대단한 동기가 필요하지 않다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ff7274f-b3cf-4197-9b84-9e644d6ca58a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-09c40899-5fca-40c3-8511-a42436fed7c7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9eb23bd4-89ff-43b0-bdf3-dbc51ed96d37\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-87b25580-f200-4c95-9f08-466cf3377076\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cc2f6bce-91cd-4819-86a6-9e30364b23a0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-776137d9-f5b0-443a-9f42-cdfd8377d75b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9dd2066b-5b52-4903-b981-6979b2e0af68\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4ad942bf-112e-467f-a011-e1c257eb1911\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-416b4da9-7111-484d-ae8b-71fd3eabe788\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-42d2088c-ce63-4b97-b11a-91092b7b1cc6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eea4bcba-5dcd-4dd2-8f4c-bdfd2253699b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5501a2fc-7dfd-4210-aca1-98b6eb09892d\">버튼을 누르면 불이 켜지듯 행동은 그냥 환경에 따라 일어난다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d87bd7d-9b56-497e-ac3a-85885d0e7376\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f8b1f38d-7c40-4cc1-933e-8fd2026113da\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af08dfc1-e356-4f5c-87be-2960884b2085\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ff29ee69-55b4-4b3d-b655-8370dcdcb1b9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-148f5644-eee0-4fdc-974a-bdec36386b2f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1d4615a2-b6b4-428b-acd8-47306a145f7e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-25afbe70-2d32-413b-8635-9077c90df6d3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b4158456-0461-479d-b3b9-321a7db894da\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bb89aa3a-8c9c-41a8-bd4a-c3bd064c5dc8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b8d1ffa3-3b4a-4c89-8b9c-d49b6d1e2fbb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-661fa870-4a3c-4b0e-87a4-9a450a0bc55c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4126ac16-e659-43c9-9103-8f65f5e197c2\">나는 전재산을 쓰겠다.  배가 고프지 않아도 호두과자에 손이 가듯 아래 행동을 만들어 줄 수 있다면. 버튼을 누르면 불이 켜지듯 할 수 있게 만들어 준다면.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7397290c-e181-4230-bdcb-7a82082584f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-65e05741-85ac-473e-908b-6a1526a8a2fb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-622b5a5e-4fbf-44f2-a35b-24c4df594875\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0a6ee032-6a29-430d-b675-2b4cb8069561\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c3686f65-b477-4dcd-af94-d00ed2640229\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b569b37c-9e2e-4b28-84bc-0a52db01e196\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-24b8862c-457a-4de5-a7a5-6e814792ed5c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9c5966de-2354-4383-8714-c2ef3bd2a0d7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8d84b40f-fa94-4436-9101-677e43f6b8c3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e832d55f-4c9f-4d8d-92b7-1952ca19000d\">디저트를 사기 전에 내 핸드폰이 꺼진다. (삼성페이 못 쓰게) &#x3D;&gt; </span><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d693e738-ab9e-4325-b641-84eb136f0e15\">₩ </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c8ab0170-5188-4611-8dc6-76261ada8a72\">1천만원</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-12e7004f-e5c0-4a29-af9b-839fd3906c0e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-04c3fe4b-b492-4804-a98a-4d5840d78123\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af3fdc59-88bd-4c87-879b-ba0c047462ea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a01866fd-ec93-4c51-b172-7f208b325452\">헬스장 앞을 지나갈때 내 발이 자동으로 헬스장 안에 들어간다 &#x3D;&gt; </span><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ed894ba9-80ae-4910-9b65-f3f5ff4cc848\">₩ </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9cb455ac-79c7-4f0c-b08f-2c806d910d2f\">3천만원</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-ali